    "Notes Updated": "5/21/2026",
    "Scouting Notes": "Slow start at Low-A to end 2025, and then again to start 2026, but he's been putting it together for a month or so now\n Looks like he's in better shape, has trimmed some of the baby fat from his build\n Swing path has improved a bit, less of a downward plane\n There's pretty big power in there, despite it not being a huge frame\n Hit tool is probably going to be average or so at best, as he is looking to lift and separate more than spray the ball around\n A bit more whiff than I expected to see from him, but it's very nice to see the patience on display\n Defense looks much better in the return to Low-A, though the reports of a strong arm from the DSL seem a bit generous. It's probably close to an average arm right now.",
    "Notes Updated 2": "1/15/2025",
    "Scouting Notes 2": "Slow start, including injury, but a really strong finish to the season\n Posted EV's of up to 107 as a 17 year old\n There are good swing decisions and bat to ball skills to go with it\n Speed is average\n Glove is reportedly solid\n Arm is reportedly pretty strong too",
